         >
        <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>+
       </text-fragment>
       <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>) is a major electron acceptor in the oxidation of fuel molecules. The reactive part of 
       <Link xmlns="http://iso.org/pdf2/ssn"
         >
        <?ReferencedObject type="Annot" page="1" ?>
       </Link>
       <?MarkedContent page="1" ?>NAD
